{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Those Who Dwell</i> is a\u00a0story-first psychological horror focused on isolation, atmosphere, and folklore. <br>Light is your only hope as you explore deeper into a cursed cave system disturbed by those who dug too deep. Restore shrines, survive the dark, and uncover what became of Those Who Dwell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore twisting tunnels, abandoned work sites, and sacred underground chambers as you discover what the miners awakened and the truth of the Hidden Folk who once called these depths home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven folk horror with psychological elements, inspired by folklore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light is your lifeline so manage your torch, oil and candles to push back the dark.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric tension, dread and discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling and interactable items that tell the story of those who came before and those who were here long before them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different endings based on your choices and how you engage with what dwells below.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Average time to complete the game: 60-120 minutes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Face the darkness. Endure the isolation. And uncover the truth before you disappear too.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All content described on this page is included in the current version of the game.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Lore Finder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3762690/43bf4ea9af09c5ffa31b1ca6fe2a60edf9375103.jpg"},{"name":"Archivist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3762690/8403ca4337dfe40d2db6a733d47035e895d